<!-- ◆温⁠启‎志‏◆⁠编‍写⁣◇‏微‌信‎﹕1⁣8‎7◆1‌9‎3‌6◇‎1‎39‍9 -->
<UserControl x:Class="NoCodeMotion.Views.NodeGraphNodeView"
             xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
             xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
             xmlns:local="clr-namespace:NoCodeMotion.Views"
             xmlns:mc="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/markup-compatibility/2006"
             xmlns:d="http://schemas.microsoft.com/expression/blend/2008"
             mc:Ignorable="d" d:DesignHeight="120" d:DesignWidth="186">
    <UserControl.Resources>
        <local:NgStringToBrush x:Key="NgStringToBrush"/>
    </UserControl.Resources>

    <!-- 根 Border：Tag=NODE（点击选中）；整卡宽度=节点几何宽度 186 -->
    <Border x:Name="Root" Width="186" CornerRadius="8" Background="White" BorderThickness="1.4" Tag="NODE"
            SnapsToDevicePixels="True">
        <Border.Style>
            <Style TargetType="Border">
                <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="#2C3E50"/>
                <!-- 选中：蓝色加粗 -->
                <Style.Triggers>
                    <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding IsSelected}" Value="True">
                        <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="#2563EB"/>
                        <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="2.6"/>
                    </DataTrigger>
                    <!-- 调试器状态色：覆盖选中色（运行中 > 已选） -->
                    <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding StepStatus}" Value="Running">
                        <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="#2563EB"/>
                        <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="3"/>
                    </DataTrigger>
                    <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding StepStatus}" Value="Done">
                        <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="#16A34A"/>
                    </DataTrigger>
                    <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding StepStatus}" Value="Error">
                        <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="#DC2626"/>
                        <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="2.6"/>
                    </DataTrigger>
                    <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding StepStatus}" Value="Paused">
                        <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="#F59E0B"/>
                        <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="2.6"/>
                    </DataTrigger>
                    <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding StepStatus}" Value="Skipped">
                        <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="#94A3B8"/>
                    </DataTrigger>
                    <!-- 当前运行节点：脉冲外发光（用 BorderThickness+加亮 + 阴影） -->
                    <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding IsCurrent}" Value="True">
                        <Setter Property="Effect">
                            <Setter.Value>
                                <DropShadowEffect Color="#2563EB" BlurRadius="14" ShadowDepth="0" Opacity="0.85"/>
                            </Setter.Value>
                        </Setter>
                    </DataTrigger>
                </Style.Triggers>
            </Style>
        </Border.Style>

        <Grid>
            <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
                <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
            </Grid.RowDefinitions>

            <!-- 标题栏：Tag=NODE_HEADER（拖拽手柄）；左侧输入端口溢出；右上角断点小红点 -->
            <Border Grid.Row="0" Height="30" CornerRadius="8,8,0,0" Tag="NODE_HEADER"
                    Background="{Binding Color, Converter={StaticResource NgStringToBrush}}">
                <Grid>
                    <Ellipse Tag="IN" Width="16" Height="16" Stroke="White" StrokeThickness="2"
                             Fill="{Binding Color, Converter={StaticResource NgStringToBrush}}"
                             HorizontalAlignment="Left" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="-8,0,0,0" Cursor="Hand"/>
                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding Title}" Foreground="White" FontWeight="SemiBold" FontSize="12"
                               HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                    <!-- 断点小圆点：仅 HasBreakpoint=True 时显示 -->
                    <Ellipse Width="10" Height="10" Fill="#DC2626" Stroke="White" StrokeThickness="1.2"
                             HorizontalAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,-3,-3,0"
                             ToolTip="该节点有断点（运行到此暂停）"
                             Visibility="{Binding HasBreakpoint, Converter={StaticResource BoolToVis}}"/>
                </Grid>
            </Border>

            <!-- 主体：先输出端口（紧接标题栏、行高固定 22），后属性摘要 -->
            <StackPanel Grid.Row="1" Margin="6">
                <!-- 输出端口（分支）-->
                <ItemsControl ItemsSource="{Binding Outputs}">
                    <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                        <DataTemplate>
                            <Grid Height="22">
                                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                                </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Text="{Binding}" Foreground="#64748B" FontSize="10.5"
                                           VerticalAlignment="Center" HorizontalAlignment="Right" Margin="0,0,4,0"/>
                                <Ellipse Grid.Column="1" Tag="OUT" Width="16" Height="16" Stroke="White" StrokeThickness="2"
                                         Cursor="Cross" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,-8,0"
                                         Fill="{Binding DataContext.Color, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=local:NodeGraphNodeView}, Converter={StaticResource NgStringToBrush}}"/>
                            </Grid>
                        </DataTemplate>
                    </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                </ItemsControl>

                <!-- 属性摘要 -->
                <ItemsControl ItemsSource="{Binding Props}" Margin="0,2,0,0">
                    <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                        <DataTemplate>
                            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,1">
                                <TextBlock Text="{Binding Name}" Foreground="#64748B" FontSize="10.5"/>
                                <TextBlock Text=":" Foreground="#64748B" FontSize="10.5" Margin="2,0"/>
                                <TextBlock Text="{Binding Value}" Foreground="#0F172A" FontSize="10.5" FontWeight="SemiBold"
                                           TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/>
                            </StackPanel>
                        </DataTemplate>
                    </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                </ItemsControl>
            </StackPanel>

            <!-- 调试器浮标：耗时 + 状态图标 + 结果摘要；仅 StepStatus != Idle 时显示 -->
            <StackPanel Grid.Row="2" Margin="6,2,6,4"
                        Visibility="{Binding StepStatus, Converter={StaticResource BoolToVis}}">
              <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                <!-- 状态图标（颜色随状态变） -->
                <TextBlock Text="{Binding StatusText}" FontSize="10.5" FontWeight="Bold" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                           Margin="0,0,6,0">
                    <TextBlock.Style>
                        <Style TargetType="TextBlock">
                            <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#64748B"/>
                            <Style.Triggers>
                                <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding StepStatus}" Value="Running">
                                    <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#2563EB"/>
                                </DataTrigger>
                                <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding StepStatus}" Value="Done">
                                    <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#16A34A"/>
                                </DataTrigger>
                                <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding StepStatus}" Value="Error">
                                    <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#DC2626"/>
                                </DataTrigger>
                                <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding StepStatus}" Value="Paused">
                                    <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#F59E0B"/>
                                </DataTrigger>
                                <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding StepStatus}" Value="Skipped">
                                    <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#94A3B8"/>
                                </DataTrigger>
                            </Style.Triggers>
                        </Style>
                    </TextBlock.Style>
                </TextBlock>
                <!-- 耗时 -->
                <TextBlock Text="{Binding DurationText}" FontSize="10.5" Foreground="#475569" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
              </StackPanel>

              <!-- 结果摘要（视觉节点回填：匹配分数 / 缺陷数 / 测量值 / 偏差 / 像素当量） -->
              <Border Background="#F1F5F9" CornerRadius="4" Padding="4,2" Margin="0,3,0,0"
                      ToolTip="{Binding Summary}"
                      Visibility="{Binding HasSummary, Converter={StaticResource BoolToVis}}">
                <TextBlock Text="{Binding Summary}" FontSize="10" Foreground="#0F172A"
                           TextWrapping="Wrap" MaxHeight="46"/>
              </Border>
            </StackPanel>

            <!-- 异常红条（仅 HasError=True 时显示） -->
            <Border Grid.Row="2" Background="#FEE2E2" BorderBrush="#DC2626" BorderThickness="0,1,0,0" Padding="6,3"
                    VerticalAlignment="Bottom"
                    ToolTip="{Binding ErrorText}"
                    Visibility="{Binding HasError, Converter={StaticResource BoolToVis}}">
                <TextBlock Text="{Binding ErrorText}" Foreground="#991B1B" FontSize="10.5"
                           TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" MaxHeight="32" TextWrapping="NoWrap"/>
            </Border>
        </Grid>
    </Border>
</UserControl>
